      "text": "nefi is an AI agent that automates code management and feature integration in Next.js codebases, primarily targeting the next-enterprise repository, via natural language commands."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_c5fbf845c7b8668dd0a9bafe5631dfc184227a38578b93784240105b7345ec5a",
